imal strategy.\n\nReason: By cloning (D,6) -> (D,7), I safely increase my material count by +1 and fill a gap in my back rank, creating a solid defensive wall. This move avoids exposing pieces to immediate capture in the center and puts the onus on the opponent to make a risky move into the middle rows, which I can then punish with a counter-attack.\n\nAnswer: (D,6) -> (D,7)'}
